      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"818d80ac23e4039c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMost of the exoplanets discovered so far have orbital periods of less than one year... More about Orbital period in StellarGuide ... Exoplanet <strong>Kepler 452 b</strong> has 5 Earth masses, or 0.34 times the mass of Uranus.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"818d80ac23e4039c\">>>",
