      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6f84d59161868627\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe team has struck gold with the discovery of a giant planet that is bigger than Earth but smaller than Saturn. The planet, dubbed <strong>TOI-6038A b</strong>, is a dense sub-Saturn size with a mass of 78.5 Earth masses and a radius of 6.41 Earth radii in ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6f84d59161868627\">>>",
